Description: CVE-2026-63718 - mod_proxy_uwsgi: drop hop-by-hop headers from backend
 Per PEP 3333 WSGI applications must not generate hop-by-hop headers.
 Remove Connection, Keep-Alive, Proxy-Authenticate, Proxy-Authorization, TE,
 Trailer, Transfer-Encoding and Upgrade headers received from the uwsgi
 backend, and close the backend connection, so that a malicious or confused
 backend cannot influence response framing (request smuggling / desync).
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/apache/httpd/commit/7c32a06bc504875544185c27cfbc6d8dc257c941
Author: Apache HTTP Server developers <dev@httpd.apache.org>
Last-Update: 2026-10-12
